    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1251415348",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Even a fairy tale has an end</><#RN#>To fight with descension,the king and queen unite to create a powerful primordium!<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"0,0,1,1\">Give it to your alpha reaper,and wait for the miracle!</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">童话也有结局</><#RN#>为了对抗堕化，国王和王后联合起来创造了一个强大的原基!<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"0,0,1,1\">把它交给你的精英死神，等待奇迹的出现!</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1257390142",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"10, 0.65, 0, 1\">God of Descension,rules the ture power of descended ark!Defeat him will let the Descension come true.Only order Warchiefs(Eternal Warrior,Tiger Emperor,Tyrant Spino) can use for battle!</><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"1, 0, 0, 1\">You'd better not use Ascensions/Descensions to challenge the god.God's punishment is not for nothing!</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"10, 0.65, 0, 1\">堕化之神，掌管方舟真正的力量！打败他就能让降临成真。只有秩序领主（永恒战士，虎皇，暴君）可以使用战斗！</><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"1, 0, 0, 1\">你最好不要使用仙化/降临来挑战神。上帝的惩罚不是无缘无故的！</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
