    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1445706950",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">As Warden Reaper died it realized who it was,not a descended executioner,but a legendary nameless hero!</><#RN#>Warden Reaper‘s legacy will let your Primordial Reaper turn into a Sane Warden Reaper！<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"0,0,1,1\">Give it to your reaper,and wait for the miracle!Give an Descension core to your warden reaper will make it stronger!</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">守卫者死神死后，它意识到自己是谁，不是一个子嗣刽子手，而是一个传奇的无名英雄!</><#RN#>守卫者死神的遗产会让你的原初死神变成一个理智的守卫者死神！<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"0,0,1,1\">把它交给你的死神，等待奇迹的出现！给你的守卫者死神一个堕化核心会让它更强大!</>","JA":""},
