    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1508750928",
      "Source": "Descended Reaper is a special species that has adapted to the light,they are extremely strong when charging!And high tier descended reapers have an ability called “Charging armor”,it could offset enemy’s damage,wild Descended reapers can use this ability at any time,tames need a lantern pet and rider to help them charging.So lantern pets are important to descended reapers!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"降临的死神是一种特殊物种，已经适应了光线，它们在冲锋时非常强大！高阶的降临死神拥有一个名为“冲锋护甲”的能力，它可以抵消敌人的伤害，野生的降临死神可以随时使用这个能力，驯服的则需要灯笼宠物和骑手帮助它们冲锋。因此，灯笼宠物对降临死神来说非常重要！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1510039248",
      "Source": "Excellent Icetitan Armor",
      "Trans": {"SC":"卓越冰原泰坦护甲","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::151229382",
      "Source": "It's a good helper!Enable Wandering to allow your otter Pick Up Nearby Artifacts From Death Item Caches!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"它是一个好帮手！启用漫游以允许你的水獭从死亡物品缓存中拾取附近的遗物！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1513995042",
      "Source": "If you cant enter vanilla Boss area and fight with those Bosses,you could summon this world Boss.This world Boss is extremely powerful,do not summon it unless you armed to teeth!It's not a good choice to challenge this guy...<#RN#>Tips:You will gain Combat Tribute once you defeat the Boss",
      "Trans": {"SC":"如果你无法进入平凡 Boss 区域并与那些 Boss 战斗，你可以召唤这个强大的世界 Boss。除非你武装到牙齿，否则不要召唤它！挑战这家伙并不是一个好选择……提示：击败 Boss 后，你将获得战斗贡品。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
