      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1534196714",
      "Source": "Kill the ancient god to unlock this engram and collect legendary soul.Give the evo core to the legendary alpha dodorex for the evolution(Must kill 25 dodorexy before using evo core).<#RN#>Then u will get a Alpha Trex.<#RN#>Alpha Trex is a special dino that could level up it's melee and health points through a challenge called\"Legendary Raid\".<#RN#>Use legendary essence in rex's inventory will give it a 900s buff called \"legendary challenge\".if your rex have this buff,all wild flyers and land dinos in 6000 range will have an opportunity to be a stalker.The max quantity of stalkers is 15(to avoid overspawning).if the stalker don't spawn for a long time,u could give a legendary essence to your rex again for a reload.kill the stalkers will gain stalker dust and other resources.<#RN#>Put more than 5 legendary essence in your Rex inventory and try to kill the stalkers to gain extra level up ponits(Once u kill a stalker with alpha rex,it will consume 5 Legendary Essence and Gain a extra level up)<#RN#>Different Stalker gives different quantity of points.<#RN#>there are 6 stalkers in total:<#RN#>raptor:1 points for damage or health<#RN#>carno:2 points for damage or health<#RN#>quetz:3 points for damage or health<#RN#>rex:4 points for damage or health<#RN#>wyvern:5 points for damage or health<#RN#>drake Boss:10 points for damage or health",
      "Trans": {"SC":"杀死远古神以解锁这个符文并收集传奇灵魂。将进化核心交给传奇精英渡渡霸王龙以进行进化（必须在使用进化核心前杀死25只渡渡霸王龙）。然后你将得到一个精英霸王龙。精英霸王龙是一种特殊的恐龙，可以通过一个名为“传奇突袭”的挑战来提升它的近战和生命值。在霸王龙的库存中使用传奇精华将给予它一个900秒的“传奇挑战”增益。如果你的霸王龙拥有这个增益，所有在6000范围内的野生飞行生物和陆地恐龙都有机会成为潜行者。潜行者的最大数量为15（为了避免过度生成）。如果长时间没有潜行者生成，你可以再次给你的霸王龙一个传奇精华以重新加载。杀死潜行者将获得潜行者尘埃和其他资源。在你的霸王龙库存中放入超过5个传奇精华，并尝试杀死潜行者以获得额外的升级点（一旦你用精英霸王龙杀死一个潜行者，它将消耗5个传奇精华并获得一个额外的升级）。不同的潜行者提供不同数量的点数。总共有6种潜行者：迅猛龙：1点伤害或生命值，南方巨兽龙：2点伤害或生命值，风神翼龙：3点伤害或生命值，霸王龙：4点伤害或生命值，飞龙：5点伤害或生命值，喷火龙：10点伤害或生命值。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
