      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1599730462",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"0, 0.65, 5, 1\">God of Ascension,rules the ture power of descended ark!Defeat him will let the Ascension come true.Only Chaos Warchiefs(Dyinglight,Galaxy,Ultimasaurus) can use for battle!</><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"1, 0, 0, 1\">You'd better not use Ascensions/Descensions to challenge the god.God's punishment is not for nothing!</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"0, 0.65, 5, 1\">神的提升，统治真正的力量，方舟！打败他就能让扬升成为现实。只有混沌领主（消光,银河,终极）可以在战斗中使用！</><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"1, 0, 0, 1\">你最好不要使用仙化/堕化生物来挑战上帝。上帝的惩罚不是无缘无故的！</>","JA":""},
