    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1881601395",
      "Source": "Congratulations,survivor!You had finally begin your decended journey.Now you could start taming excellent tier dinos!<#RN#>The next step is defeating the alpha vanilla Bosses in Boss area!They have been influenced by descended.<#RN#>kill them to gain combat essence,which is a important resource for summoning Bosses in war generator!<#RN#>If you cant enter the Boss area due to some reasons,you could summon a combat world Boss which is extremely powerful.<#RN#>Tips: only excellent,ordinary,descended tier dinos could damage those area Bosses!(Drag weight smaller 561,for example,rex=550,giga=950)",
      "Trans": {"SC":"恭喜你，幸存者！你终于开始了你的降临之旅。现在你可以开始驯服卓越等级恐龙了！<#RN#>下一步是击败在Boss区域的精英平凡Boss！他们已经受到了降临的影响。<#RN#>杀死他们以获得战斗精华，这是召唤战争生成器中Boss的重要资源！<#RN#>如果你由于某些原因无法进入Boss区域，你可以召唤一个战斗世界Boss，这是一个极其强大的Boss。<#RN#>提示：只有卓越的、平凡的、降临等级的恐龙才能对那些区域Boss造成伤害！（拖拽重量小于561，例如，霸王龙=550，巨兽龙=950）","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
