    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2228146531",
      "Source": "6.How could i tame a Primordial Reaper?How strong is Primordial Reaper?<#RN#>By evolution and sacrifice.You need to kill a Primordial reaper and unlock engram,it’s a powerful guy.It would be better to use a celestial rock drake(Rock drakes are the natural enemies of reapers).Then prepare an alpha prince and an alpha princess,the one who has crown could absorb the other,after that,put the evo item in it’s inventory.<#RN#>Primordial reaper must be the strongest tier 4 creature,even as powerful as a max progression havoc,it can easily defeat tier 5 tier 6 Bosses!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"6.我如何驯服一个原初死神？原初死神有多强？<#RN#>通过进化和献祭。你需要杀死一个原初死神并解锁基因码，这是一个强大的家伙。最好使用一个天神岩龙（岩龙是神的天敌）。然后准备一个精英王子和一个精英公主，拥有王冠的可以吸收另一个，之后，将进化物品放入它的库存中。<#RN#>原初死神必须是最强的四级生物，甚至和最大进度的灾厄一样强大，它可以轻松击败五级和六级Boss！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2230333009",
      "Source": "Summons the Seal God and challenge them.Be prepared!<RichColor Color=\"10, 0, 0, 1\">It's the Degenerate of Darkness!A malformed entity born of Dark Seals' convergence!The Last Seal!</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"召唤封印之神并挑战他们。做好准备！<RichColor Color=\"10, 0, 0, 1\">是黑暗堕落者！一个由黑暗封印聚合而成的畸形实体！最后的封印!</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
