    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2401504730",
      "Source": "2.What should i do after reapers grow up?<#RN#>when your descended prince/princess grow up,you need to put 100 luminous essence in its inventory and give it charge(Lantern pets nearby),than it will adapt the light and obtain more abilities.After adaption,your reapers are as strong as excellent Boss tier,and name change!<#RN#>Tips:Luminous essence could be collected from charging Descended lantern pets.100 charge=1essence.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"2.死神长大后我应该做什么？当你的降临王子/公主长大后，你需要在它的库存中放入100个发光精华，并给它充电（附近的灯笼宠物），然后它将适应光线并获得更多的能力。适应后，你的死神将和卓越的Boss等级一样强大，并且名字会发生变化！提示：发光精华可以从充电的降临灯笼宠物中收集。100次充电=1个精华。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
