    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2518147895",
      "Source": "Legendary evolution is starting with the alpha dodorexy(ko tame in the wild,eat devilish/divine essence).You will have 50% chance of dropping a little dodorex egg as it is killed.<#RN#>Alpha dodorexy procession:kill 25 wild dodorexy to gain extra damage and defence.<#RN#>legendary little dodorex:<#RN#>Produce legendary essence passively(Important Resource)",
      "Trans": {"SC":"传奇进化是从精英渡渡霸王龙开始的（在野外驯服，吃恶魔/神圣精华）。当它被杀死时，你有50%的几率掉落一个传奇资源渡渡鸟蛋。精英渡渡霸王龙游行：杀死25只野生渡渡霸王龙以获得额外的伤害和防御。传奇资源渡渡鸟：被动产生传奇精华（重要资源）。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
