    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2952504735",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"1, 0.65, 0, 1\">How To Summon Those Dark Seals</><#RN#>First off, put one \"Dark Altar Summon Cube\" in the altar,which you could craft one in descended war generator.<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"1, 0, 1, 1\">Than,sacrificing your dinos!</><#RN#>You need to sacrifice those dinos step by step,put the dino you want to sacrifice to the closest point.<#RN#>1.One Excellent Dino<#RN#>2.One Unreal Dino<#RN#>3.One Divine Dino<#RN#>4.One Devilish Dino<#RN#>5.One Celestial Dino<#RN#>6.One Abyssal Dino<#RN#>7.One Bionic Dino<#RN#>When you finish sacrificing,you need to put a Tamed Warchief near the atlar.<#RN#>Dying light for Beast of Darkness<#RN#>Eternal Gorilla for Beast of Oblivion<#RN#>Galaxy Warchief for Beast of Desperation<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"1, 20, 1, 1\">Tips:Those seal dinos could be tamed or defeated,it will be easier for defeating.If you want to tame them you must  consume one challenger's breath,and fight with them(Remember to fight with Beast of Darkness at night if u want to tame it)</><#RN#>Find a place where there is no overhead obstruction to summon!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"1, 0.65, 0, 1\">如何召唤那些黑暗封印</><#RN#>首先，在祭坛中放置一个“黑暗祭坛召唤魔方”，你可以在下降战争生成器中制作一个.<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"1, 0, 1, 1\">而不是献祭你的恐龙!</><#RN#>你需要一步一步地献祭那些恐龙，把你想献祭的恐龙放在最近的地方.<#RN#>1.一只卓越恐龙<#RN#>2.一只虚幻恐龙<#RN#>3.一只神圣恐龙<#RN#>4.一只恶魔恐龙<#RN#>5.一只天神恐龙<#RN#>6.一只深渊恐龙<#RN#>7.一只仿生恐龙<#RN#>当你完成献祭后，你需要在地图集附近放一个驯服的领主.<#RN#>黑暗之魂·消逝的光芒<#RN#>遗忘之兽·永恒金刚<#RN#>银河领主·绝望之翼<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"1, 20, 1, 1\">你知道吗，那些封印生物可以被驯服，也可以被打败，打败它们会更容易。如果你想驯服他们，你必须消耗一个挑战者的气息，并与他们战斗（记住，如果你想驯服它，要在晚上与黑暗之魂战斗）</><#RN#>找一个没有头顶障碍物的地方召唤!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
