    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2956714451",
      "Source": "I'm bob,a survivor.<#RN#>Now I will tell you how to get a ultimate Descended Reaper:Supreme Warden Reaper!<#RN#>First of all,you must summon one in the war generator and kill it,than get some resoures to evo your Primordial Reaper.As for the supreme evolution,you need to finish a descencion,and get descension essence for the enhance core,after eating the enhance core,it will be a descension creature!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我是鲍勃，一个幸存者。<#RN#>现在我将告诉你如何获得一个终极的降临死神：至高无上的守卫者死神！<#RN#>首先，你必须在战争生成器中召唤一个并杀死它，然后获取一些资源来进化你的原初死神。至于至高无上的进化，你需要完成一次堕化，并获取堕化精华以强化核心，吃下强化核心后，它将成为一个堕化生物！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
