    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3053311529",
      "Source": "4.How could i get an alpha reaper?<#RN#>By evolution.Kill a charging descended reaper queen wild to unlock engram and gain Queen’s shiny token for evolution item,and the reaper must be an adapted descended reaper!<#RN#>Tips:Reaper evolution will inherit descended reapers stats!so they will have same level up points!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"4.我如何获得一个精英死神？<#RN#>通过进化。杀死一个充能的野生降临死神女王以解锁基因码并获得女王的闪亮信物作为进化物品，而死神必须是一个适应性的降临死神！<#RN#>提示：死神的进化将继承降临死神的属性！所以他们将有相同的升级点数！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
