      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Heavy is the head who wears the crown!</><#RN#>Give it to your alpha reaper prince/princess to let it be a King/Queen!<#RN#>Improve your alpha reaper's damage defence and charging armor!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"\"<RichColor Color=\"\"1,0,0,1\"\">头戴王冠者重!</><lf>把它交给你的死神王子/公主，让它成为国王/王后！<lf>提高你的精英死神的伤害防御和冲锋装甲！\"","JA":""},
