    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3161739190",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"1, 0.65, 0, 1\">How To Use: How To Tame a Bionic Creature</><#RN#>First off, put your Bionic Essence of the Bionic Dino that you want to get, and then get ~1000 Descended Ingot and put it also in the machine's inventory.<#RN#>Then just press on the Start Processing option and the process should start.<#RN#><#RN#>Once your Bionic gets broken(every 10%) it will ask for Element, if it's process is 60% for example, it will require 60 Descended Ingot or in the next 10% it will die and you will have to start all over again.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"1, 0.65, 0, 1\">如何使用：如何驯服仿生生物</><#RN#>首先，放入你想要获得的仿生恐龙的仿生精华，然后获得~1000个降临锭，并将其放入机器的库存中。<#RN#>然后，只需按下Start Processing选项，进程就应该启动了。<#RN#><#RN#>一旦你的仿生被打破（每10%），它会要求元素，如果它的进程是60%，例如，它将需要60降临锭或在接下来的10%，它会死亡，你将不得不重新开始。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
