    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::31954488",
      "Source": "1.How to get a Descended reaper?<#RN#>You could find a wild Descended reaper queen in some dangerous place,like red zone in aberration,monster island in theIsland,volcano in the center etc.<#RN#>Then reduce her health percent below 10%,she will impregnate you.<#RN#>Baby reapers level up points will scale by difficulty.For example,+75 in difficulty 5,+150 in difficulty 10.And u have 50% to tame a prince,and 50% to tame a princess.<#RN#>Tips:If she doesnt look like to impregnate,try to get off your dino.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"1.如何获得一个降临死神？你可以在一些危险的地方找到野生的降临死神女王，比如畸变的红色区域、岛屿的怪物岛、中心的火山等。然后将她的健康百分比降低到10%以下，她就会与你交配。幼年死神的升级点数将根据难度等级进行缩放。例如，在难度5中+75，在难度10中+150。并且你有50%的机会驯服一个王子，也有50%的机会驯服一个公主。提示：如果她看起来不愿意交配，尝试从你的恐龙上下来。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
