      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"0,0,1,1\">As Warden Giganotosaurus died it left some legacy can be used for evolution!</><#RN#>Warden Giganotosaurus‘s legacy will let your Ancient Evo Giganotosaurus turn into a Sane Warden Giganotosaurus!Also a celestial Giganotosaurus is needed for sacrifice<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Give it to your Giganotosaurus,and wait for the miracle!Give an Ascension core to your warden Giganotosaurus will make it great!</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"0,0,1,1\">当南方巨兽龙死去时，它留下了一些可以用于进化的遗产!</><#RN#>守卫者南方巨兽龙的遗产会让你的远古南方巨兽龙变成一个守卫者南方巨兽龙！而且需要一只天神南方巨兽龙作为祭品<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">把它给你的南方巨兽龙，等待奇迹的出现！给你的守卫者一个仙化核心，巨兽龙会让它变得伟大!</>","JA":""},
