    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3813368626",
      "Source": "5.How could i evo my alpha reaper prince/princess to king/queen.<#RN#>Give them crowns:)Defeat the mega reaper(Summon in war gen),than you will get a crown,use in alpha reaper’s inventory,then they will be a king/queen.Higher damage reduction and output,and firmer charging armor.then they will have the power to defeat tier 4 Bosses.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"5.我如何将我的精英死神王子/公主进化为国王/王后。<#RN#>给他们戴上王冠：)击败在战争生成器中召唤的超级死神，然后你将获得一个王冠，将其放入精英死神的库存中，然后他们将成为国王/王后。更高的伤害减免和输出，以及更坚固的充能护甲。然后他们将拥有击败四级Boss的力量。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
