    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3847300446",
      "Source": "This specially blended pet food is a favorite of all Excellent creatures. Containing only the finest natural ingredients, it provides pets with the balanced nutrition they need. And with a taste they can't resist, they'll warm up to you in no time! Not intended for human consumption.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这种特别调配的宠物食品是所有卓越生物的最爱。它只包含最卓越的天然成分，为宠物提供所需的均衡营养。而且味道无法抗拒，它们很快就会对你产生好感！不可供人类","JA":""},
