    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3882644431",
      "Source": "Congratulations on completing Ark Descended's final battle!!!<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"10, 0, 0, 1\">Though your adventure in Descended is nearing its conclusion, your journey as a survivor will never truly end.</><#RN#>On behalf of the entire Descended mod development team, I would like to express our heartfelt gratitude to you.<#RN#>If you enjoyed this mod, please consider giving us a thumbs-up/like:)<#RN#>Wishing you a pleasant life and good gaming time!!!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"恭喜你完成了Ark降临的最终战斗!!!<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"10, 0, 0, 1\">虽然你的冒险之旅即将结束，但你作为幸存者的旅程永远不会真正结束.</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
