    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::533722386",
      "Source": "The first step is kill the Legendary drake stalker Boss which could unlock ascended legendary rex tek saddle and drop legendary rex chibi.<#RN#>It will be summoned once u killed 30 stalkers!<#RN#>Ascended legendary rex tek saddle:<#RN#>Give it to a 254 health and 254 melee alpha rex to give it a supreme bonus.it will become as strong as tier8 after equipping that saddle.<#RN#>tips:The saddle can't be removed unless the rex dies.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"第一步是杀死传奇喷火龙潜行者Boss，这将解锁升阶的传奇霸王龙泰克鞍，并掉落传奇霸王龙小雕像。一旦你杀死30个潜行者，它就会被召唤！升阶的传奇霸王龙泰克鞍：给一个254生命值和254近战的精英霸王龙装备，它将获得至高无上的增益。装备上这个鞍后，它将变得和8级一样强大。提示：除非霸王龙死亡，否则鞍不能被移除。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
