    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::597288959",
      "Source": "Use this to unleash your creature's time-space capability,once your creature has this buff,you will have opportunity to facing creatures of another dimension,the <RichColor Color=\"1,0,1,1\">Havoc</>,and the <RichColor Color=\"1,0.8,0,1\">Spectral</>!It's the only way to spawn havoc/Spectral in the wild and tame them!Won't be consumed after using!<#RN#>These dinos own unparalleled power!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个来释放你的生物的时间空间能力，一旦你的生物拥有这个增益，你将有机会面对另一个维度的生物， <RichColor Color=\"1,0,1,1\">灾厄</>,和 <RichColor Color=\"1,0.8,0,1\">灵魂</>!这是在野外刷新灾厄/灵魂并驯服它们的唯一方法！使用后不会被消耗!<#RN#>这些恐龙拥有无与伦比的力量!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::597606310",
      "Source": "Bee hives house a queen bee and produces honey.Much Faster than vanilla beehive,but will be destroy when u do a dino wipe!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"蜂巢里住着一只蜂后，并生产蜂蜜。比原版蜂巢快得多，但会在你进行恐龙清除时被摧毁！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
