    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::708971365",
      "Source": "3.How to use charging armor?<#RN#>First,you need a light adaption descended reaper,and a lantern pet on your shoulder,turn on the light.Use “ctrl”,then your reaper will collect 500 charge amount to gain a charging armor(A damage absorbing shield),charging armor remains 30 seconds for descended reapers,60s for Primordial reaper,and mega reapers armor will not go away with time.Alpha and primordial reapers charging armor could Reflect damage.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"3.如何使用充能护甲？<#RN#>首先，你需要一个轻型适应性降临死神，以及一个肩上的灯笼宠物，打开灯光。使用“ctrl”，然后你的死神将收集500点充能值以获得一个充能护甲（一个吸收伤害的盾牌），充能护甲对降临死神保持30秒，对原初死神保持60秒，而超级死神的护甲不会随时间消失。精英和原初死神的充能护甲可以反射伤害。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
