    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3750828922",
      "Source": "Bob's Note",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃的笔记","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::821521391",
      "Source": "Congratulations on completing this difficult combat!<#RN#>Survivor, you can now shift your focus to dinosaurs of those called 'Excellent Boss'. <#RN#>Wild Excellent Bosses are extremely powerful and challenging to tame. <#RN#>They summon minions after taking a certain amount of damage, and they can only be torpid when their health drops below 50%. <#RN#>Rescue these mighty beasts and then attempt to defeat the 'Sin of Unreal'. Good luck!\"",
      "Trans": {"SC":"祝贺你完成了这个困难的战斗！<#RN#>幸存者，你现在可以把你的注意力转移到那些被称为“卓越Boss”的恐龙身上。<#RN#>野生卓越Boss是非常强大和具有挑战性的驯服。<#RN#>他们会在受到一定伤害后召唤随从，并且只有当他们的生命值低于50%时才会变得迟钝。<#RN#>拯救这些强大的野兽，然后尝试击败“虚幻之罪”。祝你好运!”","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
