    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2918012384",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"10, 0, 0, 1\">The Primordial Descension,origin of the whole descended.</><#RN#><#RN#>Once you defeat this powerful Boss,you completely Finished you descended Journey!<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"128, 0, 128, 1\">Are you fully prepared?</><#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"128, 0, 128, 1\">Start your ultimate battle!</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"10, 0, 0, 1\">原初堕化，万源之始。</><#RN#><#RN#>一旦你击败这尊强力BOSS，便将圆满终结你的降临之旅！<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"128, 0, 128, 1\">你准备好了吗？</><#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"128, 0, 128, 1\">开启你的终极之战！</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2570267998",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"10, 0.65, 0.5, 1\">The Supreme warden reaper is a killer with unmatched power!</><#RN#>Tips:Find a place where there is no overhead obstruction to summon!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"10, 0.65, 0.5, 1\">至高守者卫死神，乃是力量无双的猎杀者！</><#RN#>提示：请在无头顶障碍物的区域进行召唤！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1760193112",
      "Source": "Warning:This is a disaster.Please use it in an open, spacious area.<#RN#>The strongest Tier 5 Warchief Boss.Good luck survivor!!!If it Crash your game,Try to use ini settings and ban Singularity Attack:)",
      "Trans": {"SC":"警告：此物极具破坏性，请于开阔空旷区域使用。<#RN#>这是最为强悍的五阶领主。祝各位求生者好运！！若它导致你的游戏崩溃，不妨尝试调整配置文件参数，并禁用奇点攻击！:)","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
